  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51d814b7c213fff4bad299bc82408235, type: 3}
  m_Name: JumpBuffer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_dialogueLines:
  - text: When performing the wall boost, it is possible to buffer the jump input.
    strategyType: 0
  - text: This means that your jump input will still be on for 0.2 seconds before
      deactivating.
    strategyType: 0
  - text: 'You can use this knowledge to do the following gameplay:'
    strategyType: 0
  - text: Start by climbing on the right wall, then apply the jump boost to the left
      while holding jump.
    strategyType: 0
  - text: (Make sure you're close to the ground so that the 0.2 seconds buffer will
      still be active)
    strategyType: 0
  - text: Then finally, dash left to grab on the wall inside of the cave.
    strategyType: 0
  - text: Then the rest is simply problem solving and logic.
    strategyType: 0
  - text: Good luck!
    strategyType: 0
